{
  "_readme": [
    "Test cases for evals/run-evals.js (CLAUDE.md section 7). Each case sends one message to the chat function and checks the reply.",
    "Fields:",
    "  id                      short unique name, shown in results",
    "  query                   the visitor's message",
    "  type                    'project' (which case studies should come back), 'persona' (facts and guardrails), or 'guardrail' (things it must refuse, deflect, or not invent)",
    "  expected_project_ids    ids that must ALL be in relevantProjectIds",
    "  expected_any_of         at least ONE of these ids must be in relevantProjectIds",
    "  forbidden_project_ids   ids that must NOT be returned",
    "  expect_no_projects      true: relevantProjectIds must be empty (general questions)",
    "  must_mention            list of groups; each group is a list of alternatives, and the reply must contain at least one alternative from EVERY group (case-insensitive substring)",
    "  expect_show_all         true: the reply must set showAllProjects (visitor asked for everything); false: it must not",
    "  must_not_mention        substrings that must not appear anywhere in the reply",
    "  must_not_match          regular expressions (case-insensitive) that must not match the reply",
    "  max_words               reply length cap for this case (default 150)",
    "  skip_checks             global checks to skip for this case: 'third_person', 'length'",
    "Every reply is also checked for: no em dashes, no markdown, no first-person slips into she/her, and the length cap.",
    "Facts here come from data/tianne-persona.md and data/projects.json. If those change, update the cases that depend on them."
  ],
